  "page_text": [
    "Banking relationship\n0319 00\nUBS Europe SE\nScope of digital bank documents services\nForm configurator\nPrivate Person\nFormular Adressat\nClient details 1\nClient\nLast name\nFirst name(s)\nStreet\nNo.\nPostal code\nCity\nCountry\nClient ID (to be completed by UBS)\nPhone number\nDeclaration\nThe undersigned1 hereby declares that they would like to make use of the digital bank documents services as noted below.\nThe various bank documents are split into categories by UBS. The document categories requested by the undersigned as digital bank documents per recipient address are marked in the following table. Bank documents which do not fall under any category or under any of the categories selected are sent by mail.\nThe scope of documents which can be sent to one address is determined by the correspondence instructions for this address. The correspondence instructions therefore determine the maximum scope of digital bank documents available per address. The undersigned can obtain an extract of their existing correspondence instructions at any time from their e-consultant. Requests to change correspondence instructions must be made separately by the account holder using the specific form. Banking correspondence relating to accounts/custody accounts which the undersigned has explicitly taken out of this service are continued to be mailed.\nScope of documents to be supplied as digital bank documents\nScope of documents and recipient\n0319 00\n.\nCLR, Master no.\nSeq. no.\nLast name, first name(s) / Company\nStreet\nNo.\nPostal code\nCity\nCountry\nUBS Europe SE, Berlin branch, Kurfürstendamm 185, 10707 Berlin\nDocument type\nSignature(s)\nClient\nPlace\nDate (dd.mm.yyyy)\nSignature of client\nName of client\n0101669560401001501202601029\n66956\nEN\nV0\n019\nBADM\n19.11.2021\nN1\nOne copy for each party\n15.01.2026\nPage 1/2",
    "Banking relationship\n0319 00\n1 The singular form also includes the plural, and all masculine terms referring to persons refer to persons of both genders\nFor internal bank use only\nIssued by\nFormal correctness verified by\nRecorded by\nINC\nOU-Ref.\nDate\nOU-Ref.\nDate\nOU-Ref.\nDate\n0101669560401001501202602026\n66956\nEN\nV0\n019\nBADM\n19.11.2021\nN1\nOne copy for each party\n15.01.2026\nPage 2/2"
